      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Ibn Mahboub, from Hisham Bin Salim, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘If I<sup>asws</sup> were to reconcile between two, it would be more beloved to me<sup>asws</sup> than if I were to give charity with two Dinars’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. It is narrated from him (narrator of the Hadith above) from ibn Mahbub from Hisham ibn Salim from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “To improve good relations beween two people is more beloved to me than giving two Dinar in charity.” "
        ]
      }
